[thin] Specified fit: the TPU 90A ring that presses the 0.5 mm PTFE vent membrane into its 2.75 mm cap pocket is 2 mm thick, so the filter, the ring and 0.25 mm of clearance fill the pocket (cold-core/reservoir/vent.md). Its 13.5 mm outside diameter is a light interference in the 13.3 mm pocket.
alternatives: A thicker ring stands proud of the cap face; a deeper pocket thins the cap ceiling over the splash baffle.
